<Base title="About">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span class="arrow">▸</span>
    <span class="current">About</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      This is <em>Bedroom Dialectics</em>—mostly just a quiet corner for me to write down thoughts that are too long for a tweet and too informal for anything serious.
    </p>

    <p>
      I write about things I notice, questions I haven't quite figured out, and the small contradictions of everyday life: wanting to get things done while wanting to do nothing, needing people while enjoying quiet rooms, and trying to make sense of things as they happen.
    </p>

    <p>
      Nothing here is meant as advice or a final conclusion. It's more of an open scratchpad for ideas while they're still in progress.
    </p>

    <p>
      If something here resonates with you or sparks an idea of your own, feel free to reach out.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
